{"3918060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Born to Burn: Ash and Flesh - A Tale from Surrealidade", "steam_appid": 3918060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Born to Burn: Ash and Flesh is a new tale in the cult and weird universe of Surrealidade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to enter an interactive fable! Disturbing, poetic, and unpredictable. An experimental game that bends the boundaries of reality and takes you on an existential journey unlike any other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll witness and control the surreal life cycle of an enigmatic creature. It all begins with a spark... moves through the womb... gains motion as a sphere... and transforms into something never seen before. Each stage of this evolution brings a unique gameplay style, evoking sensations as diverse as the universe surrounding you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Interactive experiences with varied styles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Sensory third-person exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Introspective first-person immersion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Control of a sphere with absurd physics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Platforming challenges in 2.5D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Secret-hunting in semi-open world stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Retro arcade-inspired visual levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Dreamlike walks through enigmatic cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• The weight of dark humor and ritualistic soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p clas