ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Dreamlike walks through enigmatic cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• The weight of dark humor and ritualistic soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the creator of <i>Surrealidade</i>, Dimitri Kozma, this new work expands into uncharted dimensions, crossing genres, defying expectations, and revealing the mysteries of a world where nothing is what it seems… and what seems may never have existed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌀 Watch the trailer ❤️ Add to your Wishlist 🔥 Soon, the fire awakens!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Born to Burn: Ash and Flesh is a surreal, experimental indie game that blends psychological horror, platforming, and exploration as players control an evolving creature through diverse gameplay styles and metaphysical challenges.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Assamese, Azerbaijani, Bangla, Basque, Belarusian, Bosnian, Catalan, Cherokee, Croatian, Dari, Estonian, Filipino, Galician, Georgian, Gujarati, Hausa, Hebrew, Hindi, Icelandic, Igbo, Irish, K'iche', Kannada, Kazakh, Khmer, Kinyarwanda, Konkani, Kyrgyz, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Macedonian, Malay, Malayalam, Maltese, Maori, Marathi, Mongolian, Nepali, Odia, Persian, Punjabi (Gurmukhi), Punjabi (Shahmukhi), Quechua, Scots, Serbian, Sindhi, Sinhala, Slovak, Slovenian, Sorani, Sotho, Swahili, Tajik, Tamil, Tatar, Telugu, Tigrinya, Tswana, Turkmen, Urdu, Uyghur, Uzbek, Valencian, Welsh, Wolof, Xhosa, Yoruba, Zulu", "